			"notes": "Minecraft 1.21.1, NeoForge 21.1.219, Create 6.0.9. Update the server and every client together. Back up your world first.\n\n## New\n\n- **Spark Crown**: chunk loader. Up to 25 chunks, picked on a region map. Runs on FE.\n- **Storm Coil**: Tesla coil. Zaps hostile mobs and stores lightning strikes as FE.\n- **PDU Cabinet**: two-block PDU with a glass door, live screen and pilot lamps.\n- **Security Relay**: redstone output for alarm, fire, flood, breach and other house states.\n- **Aerial Flight Deck**: 2x1 cockpit for a captain and a first officer. Recipe: two VCC Mk IV Aerials.\n- **Co-pilot**: two players can drive a VCC Mk IV or fly an Aerial at once.\n- Home Security Panel: Storm Coils tab, with who each coil arcs at in every house state.\n- Route vehicles keep travelling while out of sight. `/pathways travel` follows one.\n- `/vcc4`: `destroy` and `status`; operators also get `destroy all`, `disarm` and `arm`.\n- Join escape: while `config/create_stats-join-escape.txt` exists, joining a server stands you up and runs its commands.\n\n## Changed\n\n- VCC Mk IV Aerial: new 1930s cockpit. Yoke, six live gauges, throttle levers, glareshield lamps, instrument lights.\n- Battery Controller: the reserve band is set per controller, in minutes of Critical or percent of the banks, on a ruler you can drag.\n- Inventory Display redesigned: real slots, rates, LOW and HIGH relays, chart recorder, ledger.\n- Storm Coil: real recorded sounds, every part shows its job, the orb watches what's in reach.\n- Headlights light the road as a cone with shadows.\n- A VCC Mk IV console that crashes removes itself and drops its item. The server keeps running.\n- VCC Mk IV and Aerial: drive from a seat within 2 blocks of the console.\n- PDU studs 1 and 2 take an HV Line. Battery Controller inputs take two.\n- Cakes use Create's Wheat Flour.\n- Ponder scenes for the Spark Crown and Storm Coil.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- Battery Controller: Critical losing most of its power the moment the banks crossed the floor.\n- Banks wired straight to a PDU ignoring the band.\n- VCC Mk IV Aerial: big or tilted ships sinking on Anchor, big ships missing their sketch.\n- VCC Mk IV: routes and swivel bearings not waking a parked vehicle.\n- Power Track: heavy trains charging at half rate.\n- Battery Controller capped at 64,000 FE/t in total.\n- PDU: machines flickering on the buffer.\n- Home Security: link card permission hole, lost roster and log changes.\n\n## Before you update\n\n- VCC Mk IV seats more than 2 blocks from the console no longer drive.\n- Inventory Display side signals are gone. Use the LOW and HIGH relays or a Display Link.\n- Battery Controller config `portRate` is now `terminalRate`.\n- Old Flour is no longer made. Craft it into Create's Wheat Flour.\n- Route vehicles no longer load chunks. Use a Spark Crown."
		},
